  "tagline": "Fiducials found, pixels turned into millimetres, a board put right.",
  "description": "EH3D-VISION-STUDIO is a Rust library and command line that find round fiducial marks in a picture and work out the turn and the shift that put a board where its design says. Built with the gui feature it also has a window (egui) that opens a picture, shows the marks, sets the scale, fits the distortion of the lens and aligns with the design. It has no live camera yet.",
